'' TKO0166: ONE 'tiko build' OF AN OUTPUT AT A TIME (tiko-build RFC-0001 §7, PLAN B1). The
'' program holds build/.blk/app.exe's lock and runs that build, which refuses and exits 1.
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' CLEAN: build/.blk
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/driver/src/build-lock-holder.bas -o build/.blk/holder.exe
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: build/.blk/holder.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: error TKO0166: another build of 'build/.blk/app.exe' is running
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: rc= 1
